# ── Public-repo hygiene ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is public and auto-deploys. Development-process, career and
# session material lives in the private archive or the local-only working
# store and must never be committed here. Enforced at commit time by
# .githooks/pre-commit; these entries stop it being staged in the first place.
memory/
efficiency/
legacy/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE_HISTORY.md
CHANGELOG.md
PRD_ADDENDUM_*.md
NEXT_SESSION_BRIEF.md
BACKLOG.md
RESEARCH_REFRESH.md
_index.md
SESSION_*_LEARNINGS.md
*.docx
scripts/test-data/
